# What the server image's build context leaves out (`apps/server/Dockerfile`). Dependencies are
# installed inside the build from the lockfile, so a host's node_modules would only be a stale
# copy; secrets and local state never enter a layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.claude
.agents
.graft
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.override.yml
docs
